e":10110,"params":["When our god and our savior arrive,the Entity will attempt to manipulate theminto shattering the lightbulb at the topof the spire."]},{"code":12330,"params":[0,29,0]},{"code":10110,"params":["Our god is the only thing this Entity cancommunicate with; it is through themthat the savior will be tricked."]},{"code":12330,"params":[0,29,0]},{"code":10110,"params":["Shattering the ligthbulb will \\c[3]return the saviorto their home world\\c[0], leaving ours to crumble.\\!But, as far as we know, this is the \\c[3]only way forthe savior to return home\\c[0]."]},{"code":12330,"params":[0,29,0]},{"code":10110,"params":["What do we do in a situation like this?\\!Tell the truth, causing the savior to leave?\\!Lie, only to have the entity reveal the truth?"]},{"code":12330,"params":[0,29,0]},{"code":10110,"params":["We can only hope they will have enoughrespect for the world they've seen whenstanding at the top of the spire andjuding our fates."]},{"code":12330,"params":[0,30,0]},{"code":10130,"params":[1,1,0,"niko"]},{"code":10110,"params":[".\\..\\.."]},{"code":10110,"params":["I don't want to end this world...\\!Is that what will happen if I leave..?"]},{"code":10320,"params":[0,0,31,0,1]},{"code":12010,"params":[1,47,0,1,0,1]},{"code":10130,"params":[0,1,0,"george"],"indent":1},{"code":10110,"params":["I'm sure you realize theimportance of savingME, yes?"],"indent":1},{"code":10110,"params":["\"To enter the Tower is toleave at the start.\"That's what the book said."],"indent":1},{"code":10110,"params":["Now take this, and remembermy beauty forever."],"indent":1},{"code":11510,"params":[0,50,100,50,"(OFF)"],"indent":1},{"code":11550,"params":[100,100,50,"major_puzzle_solved"],"indent":1},{"code":10130,"params":[0,1,0,"niko"],"indent":1},{"code":10110,"params":["A die..."],"indent":1},{"code":10130,"params":[0,1,0,"george"],"indent":1},{"code":10110,"params":["Hopefully it reminds you ofthe terrible loss should youdecide to abandon us, yes?"],"indent":1},{"